<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: bastionmeld -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.label>铁骸母兽</FH_Bastionmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: flesh deadguard -->
  <FH_FleshDeadguard.label>血肉死卫</FH_FleshDeadguard.label>
  <!-- EN: A temporary fleshbeast guard summoned by a fleshbeast meld. -->
  <FH_FleshDeadguard.description>由血肉母兽召唤的临时血肉兽守卫。</FH_FleshDeadguard.description>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. Its body is embedded with the remnants of various mechanoids. Through some form of supernatural energy, the bastionmeld controls weapons that once belonged to mechanoids. Bastionmelds rarely appear in raids and can usually only be summoned through rituals. In combat, the bastionmeld usually constructs defensive fortifications and wears enemies down through sustained long-range combat. -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.description>由数几十只小型血肉兽组成的庞然大物，通过松散相连的中枢神经系统协调统一。身躯上镶嵌着各种机械族的残骸。通过某种超自然能量控制着这些原本属于机械族的武装。铁骸母兽很少出现在袭击中，通常只能通过仪式召唤。铁骸母兽在战斗中通常会不断组装持枪血肉兽，以远距离战斗战胜敌人。</FH_Bastionmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出现。</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Beam Incinerator Cannon -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret.turrets.0.label>焚灭脉冲炮</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret.turrets.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Flesh weapon mount -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret.turrets.1.label>血肉武器基座</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret.turrets.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Flesh weapon mount -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret.turrets.2.label>血肉武器基座</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret.turrets.2.label>
  <!-- EN: Flesh weapon mount -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret.turrets.3.label>血肉武器基座</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret.turrets.3.label>
  <!-- EN: Release an EMP pulse centered on the host, matching an IED EMP trap's radius. -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主控制两个寄生武器装备位，并以自身为中心释放圆形EMP脉冲，范围与EMP地雷一致。</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Bastionmeld weapon mounts and EMP pulse -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>铁骸母兽武器装备位与EMP脉冲</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Flesh parasitism mood -6; Social Impact -5%; grants impossible regeneration; adds two parasitic weapon mounts. -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-10%；扭曲肉容量+400；宿主获得再生（不可思议）；提供2个额外的寄生武器装备位。</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.tools.tentacle-0.label>触手</FH_Bastionmeld.tools.tentacle-0.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.tools.tentacle-1.label>触手</FH_Bastionmeld.tools.tentacle-1.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.tools.head.label>头</FH_Bastionmeld.tools.head.label>

  <FH_Nexusmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>母兽触手</FH_Nexusmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <FH_Nexusmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主体表生长两条母兽触手，每条造成14点锐器伤害，攻击冷却2秒，护甲穿透40%。</FH_Nexusmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <FH_Furiousmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>盾爪触手</FH_Furiousmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <FH_Furiousmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主体表生长两条盾爪触手，每条造成16点钝器伤害，攻击冷却3秒。</FH_Furiousmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <FH_Fissionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>母兽触手</FH_Fissionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <FH_Fissionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主体表生长两条母兽触手，每条造成14点锐器伤害，攻击冷却2秒，护甲穿透40%，并可使用血肉重生。</FH_Fissionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
