  <!-- EN: dreadmeld -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.label>惊惧母兽</FH_Dreadmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A gargantuan amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts linked together by a loosely shared central nervous system. It uses its massive claws to dig tunnels through solid rock. Fleshbeast dreadmelds are rarely seen above ground, instead sheltering in caverns built from living flesh. They share a psychic connection with the flesh used to create their burrow. -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.description>由数十只小型血肉兽聚合而成的庞然巨物，以松散共享的中枢神经系统连接在一起。它会用巨大的爪肢在坚岩中挖掘隧道。惊惧母兽很少出现在地表，通常栖身于活体血肉构成的洞窟中，并与构成巢穴的血肉保持心灵连接。</FH_Dreadmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出现。</FH_Dreadmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主体表生长两条母兽触手，每条造成14点锐器伤害，攻击冷却2秒，护甲穿透40%，并可释放惊惧咆哮。</FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>母兽触手</FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-10%；扭曲肉容量+400；宿主获得再生（不可思议）；采矿速度+160%；深钻井操作速度+70%；提供两条母兽触手和“惊惧咆哮”主动能力。</FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.tools.tentacle-0.label>触手</FH_Dreadmeld.tools.tentacle-0.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.tools.tentacle-1.label>触手</FH_Dreadmeld.tools.tentacle-1.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.tools.head.label>头</FH_Dreadmeld.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: fissionmeld -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.label>裂殖母兽</FH_Fissionmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. Its body undergoes constant rapid hyperplasia, with new fleshbeasts budding from its form at regular intervals. These parasitic offspring make the fissionmeld a terrifying meat grinder. Fissionmelds rarely appear in raids and can usually only be summoned through rituals. Upon death, the fissionmeld enters a dormant state and will eventually regenerate. -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.description>由数十只小型血肉兽聚合而成的庞然巨物，以松散连接的中枢神经系统维系整体。它的身体持续高速增生，会定期从躯体上萌生新的血肉兽。这些寄生子嗣让裂殖母兽成为可怕的血肉绞肉机。裂殖母兽很少出现在袭击中，通常只能通过仪式召唤。死亡后，裂殖母兽会进入休眠状态，并最终再生。</FH_Fissionmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出现。</FH_Fissionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: left bone spike -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.tools.left_bone_spike.label>左骨刺</FH_Fissionmeld.tools.left_bone_spike.label>
  <!-- EN: right bone spike -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.tools.right_bone_spike.label>右骨刺</FH_Fissionmeld.tools.right_bone_spike.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.tools.head.label>头</FH_Fissionmeld.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: fleshtitan -->
  <FH_Fleshtitan.label>血肉泰坦</FH_Fleshtitan.label>
  <!-- EN: The heart of the fleshbeast catastrophe - a fleshmass heart that has somehow grown limbs. Its extreme regenerative capabilities render it nearly invulnerable. Almost no known method can harm the fleshtitan. Its near-limitless strength allows it to destroy any obstacle in its path. The fleshtitan moves extremely slowly and will revert to a fleshmass heart after a period of time. -->
  <FH_Fleshtitan.description>血肉兽灾变的核心，一只不知如何长出肢体的血肉心脏。超快的再生速度让心脏几乎无懈可击。几乎没有任何已知的方式能够伤害血肉泰坦。近乎无限的怪力使其可以摧毁一切阻挡它前进的障碍。血肉泰坦的移动极其缓慢，而且会在一段时间后重新变为血肉心脏。</FH_Fleshtitan.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Fleshtitan.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出现。</FH_Fleshtitan.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: left arm -->
  <FH_Fleshtitan.tools.left_arm.label>左臂</FH_Fleshtitan.tools.left_arm.label>
  <!-- EN: heavy punch -->
  <FH_Fleshtitan.tools.left_arm.labelNoLocation>重拳</FH_Fleshtitan.tools.left_arm.labelNoLocation>
  <!-- EN: right arm -->
  <FH_Fleshtitan.tools.right_arm.label>右臂</FH_Fleshtitan.tools.right_arm.label>
  <!-- EN: heavy punch -->
  <FH_Fleshtitan.tools.right_arm.labelNoLocation>重拳</FH_Fleshtitan.tools.right_arm.labelNoLocation>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Fleshtitan.tools.head.label>头</FH_Fleshtitan.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: furiousmeld -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.label>暴怒母兽</FH_Furiousmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. It grows a thick carapace of living iron and can project a spherical bioprotective forcefield that allows bullets to pass out but not in. Furiousmelds rarely appear in raids and can usually only be summoned through rituals. In combat, the furiousmeld charges headlong to destroy defenses, clearing a path for lesser fleshbeasts to overwhelm the enemy. -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.description>由数十只小型血肉兽聚合而成的庞然巨物，以松散连接的中枢神经系统维系整体。它生有厚重的活体钢铁甲壳，并能投射球形生物防护力场，允许子弹由内向外穿过，却会阻挡外部射击。暴怒母兽很少出现在袭击中，通常只能通过仪式召唤。战斗时，它会正面冲锋摧毁防御，为较小的血肉兽开辟突破敌阵的道路。</FH_Furiousmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出现。</FH_Furiousmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: left horn -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.tools.left_horn.label>左角</FH_Furiousmeld.tools.left_horn.label>
  <!-- EN: right horn -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.tools.right_horn.label>右角</FH_Furiousmeld.tools.right_horn.label>
  <!-- EN: carapace -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.tools.carapace.label>甲壳</FH_Furiousmeld.tools.carapace.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.tools.head.label>头</FH_Furiousmeld.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: harnessed fleshtitan -->
  <FH_HarnessedFleshtitan.label>受控血肉泰坦</FH_HarnessedFleshtitan.label>
  <!-- EN: The heart of the fleshbeast catastrophe - a fleshmass heart that has somehow grown limbs. Its extreme regenerative capabilities render it nearly invulnerable. Almost no known method can harm the fleshtitan. Its near-limitless strength allows it to destroy any obstacle in its path. The fleshtitan moves extremely slowly and will revert to a fleshmass heart after a period of time. Under the restraint of an archotechnological device, the fleshtitan can accept simple commands and participate in combat. -->
  <FH_HarnessedFleshtitan.description>血肉兽灾变的核心，一只不知如何长出肢体的血肉心脏。超快的再生速度让心脏几乎无懈可击。几乎没有任何已知的方式能够伤害血肉泰坦。近乎无限的怪力使其可以摧毁一切阻挡它前进的障碍。血肉泰坦的移动极其缓慢，而且会在一段时间后重新变为血肉心脏。在超凡智能装置的约束下，血肉泰坦能够接受简单的指令并参与战斗。</FH_HarnessedFleshtitan.description>
