  <!-- EN: right arm -->
  <FH_HarnessedFleshtitan.tools.right_arm.label>右臂</FH_HarnessedFleshtitan.tools.right_arm.label>
  <!-- EN: heavy punch -->
  <FH_HarnessedFleshtitan.tools.right_arm.labelNoLocation>重拳</FH_HarnessedFleshtitan.tools.right_arm.labelNoLocation>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_HarnessedFleshtitan.tools.head.label>头</FH_HarnessedFleshtitan.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: nexusmeld -->
  <FH_Nexusmeld.label>统合母兽</FH_Nexusmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. The nexusmeld is the core of the fleshbeast swarm's coordination, using its powerful psychic abilities to command other fleshbeasts in assaults. Nexusmelds rarely appear in raids, preferring to lurk within nests supported by fleshmass hearts, with which they share a psychic bond. -->
  <FH_Nexusmeld.description>由数十只小型血肉兽聚合而成的庞然巨物，以松散连接的中枢神经系统维系整体。统合母兽是血肉兽群协调行动的核心，利用强大的心灵能力指挥其他血肉兽发起进攻。它们很少出现在袭击中，更喜欢潜伏在由血肉心脏支撑的巢穴内，并与心脏保持心灵连接。</FH_Nexusmeld.description>
